{"title":"Subtly Geometric Birds","link":"https://kottke.org/25/05/subtly-geometric-birds","date":1746552840000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1308\" alt=\"illustration of a blue scrub jay\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1286\" alt=\"illustration of a colorful Major Mitchell's cockatoo\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/aled-thompson-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1294\" alt=\"illustration of a blue/gray shoebill stork\" /></p>\n\n<p>There’s something a little bit mesmerizing about <a href=\"https://www.inprnt.com/gallery/thompson_art/\">Aled Thompson’s illustrations of birds</a>. They are at once highly detailed and also slightly vectorish — and it shifts back and forth while I’m looking at them, like one of those <a href=\"https://www.livescience.com/63645-optical-illusion-young-old-woman.html\">young woman/old woman optical illusions</a>.</p>\n\n<p>You can find more of Thompson’s work on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/aled.thompson\">Instagram</a> and <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/aledthompson.bsky.social\">Bluesky</a> and <a href=\"https://www.inprnt.com/gallery/thompson_art/\">can purchase prints here</a>. (via <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/mims.bsky.social/post/3ln6iqbnzn22j\">@mims.bsky.social</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Aled%20Thompson\">Aled Thompson</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/birds\">birds</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/illustration\">illustration</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/05/subtly-geometric-birds\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"31c7b1cbfaf8c19a14e4fec374621f36c4f4c19cbeff4cdf8852609ee9ffff87","category":"Sites"}